{
  "name": "Generate AI videos with Seedance and post them to TikTok",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Generate AI videos with Seedance and post them to TikTok\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Runs when you click Execute Workflow.\n2. Sets the post topic that guide the AI-written content.\n3. Uses OpenAI to write the post copy and parses it into per-platform fields.\n4. Generates the video with Seedance on Replicate, waits for it to finish, and downloads the file.\n5. Publishes a post to TikTok via the SocialRobot API.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Install the SocialRobot community node and connect your SocialRobot API credential (API key: socialrobot.io, Scheduler -> API Keys).\n- [ ] Connect your Replicate account in the Check Status and Generate Video (Seedance) nodes.\n- [ ] In the Set video topic node, set the post topic to your own content.\n- [ ] Select your TikTok account in the Publish to TikTok node.\n\n### Customization\n\nEdit the prompt in the AI Video Prompt Writer node, or change the OpenAI model, to tune the tone of the copy.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 632
      },
      "id": "61d07f10-283e-4ac1-bdeb-0bb6fa124288",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        40,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
